		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">5</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">What is the meaning of rotating array 
clockwise, m times, in this assignment?
Option 1: Shifting each element of array 
to the left side by m times.
Option 2: Shifting each element of array 
to the right side by m times.
</attribute>
