		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">53</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Let us convert the algorithm step by step.

There are various things to be implemented.
a. Taking input as an integer (step 2).
b. Creating new variable (steps 3,5 and 6).
c. Read space separated integers (step 1).
d. Displaying output (step 7 and 9).
e. Repeating the process for one number at a time (steps 8 and 10).

We have discussed all of the above in previous assignments multiple times. Take a paper and write the code for our algorithm.</attribute>
